<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Nat'l Processing cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Nat'l Processing cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Smith Barney downgraded National Processing Inc to neutral from outperform, a Smith Barney source said.</p>
<p>-- National Processing closed Wednesday at 13-7/8.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>	  (( -- Wall Street desk 212-859-1730))</p>
